---
const steps = [
  {
    n: '01',
    t: 'Write',
    d: 'Gherkin scenarios in .feature files. Tags, backgrounds, scenario outlines, examples: parsed by @cucumber/gherkin and validated in Monaco as you type.',
    thumb: `@auth @smoke
Feature: OIDC Login
  Scenario: Login
    Given I am here
    When I click
    Then I am in`,
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    t: 'Organize',
    d: 'Group features into projects. The folder structure on disk is the structure in the UI. Drag, rename, regroup without touching JSON.',
    thumb: `atlas-web/
  auth/
    oidc-login.feature
    logout.feature
  checkout/
    cart.feature`,
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    t: 'Run',
    d: 'Trigger runs by hand from the cockpit, or push cucumber.json via the ingest endpoint from your CI. Trace records the result. It does not schedule, queue, or retry.',
    thumb: `$ curl -X POST .../api/executions/ingest
  → execution started
  → 8 scenarios queued

● Login    1.2s
● Logout   0.9s
✕ Refresh  timeout`,
  },
  {
    n: '04',
    t: 'Keep',
    d: 'Every execution, every scenario, every attached screenshot: stored, filterable, exportable to CSV. The history is the audit trail.',
    thumb: `# last 24h
● 142 executions
● 96.4% pass
✕ 4 scenarios failing
# export
↓ executions.csv`,
  },
];
---

<section id="how" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-2xl">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-3">
        <span class="inline-block size-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
        What it does
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
        Four things. That's the product.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-ink-2 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Write Gherkin, organize features, run scenarios, keep history. We're not adding a fifth, and we like it that way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-12">
      {steps.map((s) => (
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[80px_1fr_minmax(280px,420px)] md:items-start md:gap-10">
          <div class="font-mono text-[42px] leading-none font-semibold text-ink-mute tabular-nums">
            <b class="text-accent font-semibold">{s.n}</b>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">{s.t}</div>
            <p class="text-ink-2 leading-relaxed max-w-[52ch]">{s.d}</p>
          </div>
          <pre class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-4 font-mono text-[12px] text-ink-2 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre">{s.thumb}</pre>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
